  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Registry of Farmed Types of Aquatic Genetic Resources</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective is to enhance the ability of national and regional stakeholders to track information on AqGR species level (i.e. Farmed Types) through the provision of information management tools and capacity building, with the direct goal of improving the regulation and monitoring of- and access to AqGR for food and agriculture.</narrative>
